<p>The platform uses only the cookies and browser storage needed to work. It does not use advertising or third-party analytics cookies, so no consent banner is required for them.</p>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td><code>ca_session</code></td><td>Keeps you signed in and protects forms against cross-site request forgery. HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Secure over HTTPS.</td><td>Until the browser closes or the session expires</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>ca_locale</code></td><td>Remembers the interface language you chose (EN/FR).</td><td>12 months</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>ca-theme</code> (local storage)</td><td>Remembers light or dark theme. Never sent to the server.</td><td>Until cleared</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>Social sharing buttons are plain links to LinkedIn and Facebook; those sites set their own cookies only when you click through to them.</p>
